         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview: Import WBPP setups from loaded icons or .xpsm files to populate folders and the review list automatically. Combine sources in one selector, make Scan/Import alternative workflows, and compact the autofocus controls.
            </p>
